<http://data.silknow.org/object/6d6c8080-9cf2-3d06-b947-9f4226cdbd1a/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Panel of woven silk, comprised of two smaller panels that have been joined together.\n\nA small spray of pink and cream flowers slightly overlaps a cartouche of irregular shape with a white cannelé ground. There are four of these in the width of the silk, and they are arranged in reverse direction on alternate rows. The ground between the cartouches is in cream twill with small seed shapes in pink and white."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/6d6c8080-9cf2-3d06-b947-9f4226cdbd1a> .

